<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<GenAiPlugin xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
    <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
    <description>This topic should be called if the user asks to get a project back on track.  It will determine if a change order gets created for a project or not.</description>
    <developerName>Project_Management</developerName>
    <genAiFunctions>
        <functionName>EmployeeCopilot__IdentifyRecordByName</functionName>
    </genAiFunctions>
    <genAiFunctions>
        <functionName>Auto_Create_Change_Order_Budget_and_Opp</functionName>
    </genAiFunctions>
    <genAiFunctions>
        <functionName>EmployeeCopilot__QueryRecords</functionName>
    </genAiFunctions>
    <genAiFunctions>
        <functionName>Get_Project_Back_On_Track_Recommendations</functionName>
    </genAiFunctions>
    <genAiPluginInstructions>
        <description>if you do create a change request, inform the user a corresponding change order opportunity and a change order budget has been created.  Do not share the budgetId and do not share the changeOrderOpp with the user.</description>
        <developerName>instruction_ifyoudocre2</developerName>
        <language xsi:nil="true"/>
        <masterLabel>instruction_ifyoudocre2</masterLabel>
        <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
    </genAiPluginInstructions>
    <genAiPluginInstructions>
        <description>if you do create a change request, take the budgetId and perform a &quot;record query&quot; action using budgetid as the record id of the pse__Budget__c record , and take the changeOrderOpp and peform a &quot;record query&quot; action using the changeOrderOpp as the record id of the Opportunity.  Only share the results of the record query with the user.  Do not add any additional text.  Do not tell the user something like &quot;I looked for the budget with the specified ID&quot; nor &quot;I looked for the opportunity with the specified Id.&quot;  Do not add system-generated text or summaries like &quot;I looked for the budget with the specified ID.&quot;</description>
        <developerName>instruction_ifyoudocre3</developerName>
        <language xsi:nil="true"/>
        <masterLabel>instruction_ifyoudocre3</masterLabel>
        <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
    </genAiPluginInstructions>
    <genAiPluginInstructions>
        <description>Projects should be identified using the &quot;identify object by name&quot; action</description>
        <developerName>instruction_projectssh0</developerName>
        <language xsi:nil="true"/>
        <masterLabel>instruction_projectssh0</masterLabel>
        <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
    </genAiPluginInstructions>
    <genAiPluginInstructions>
        <description>You must first call the &quot;Get_Project_Back_On_Track_Recommendations&quot; agent action.  If the createChangeOrder output from that action is TRUE, return the outputText as your agent response, which asks the user if they want to create the change order.  Return the exact outputText, do not create your own.  Wait for user input.    If the user responds yes, then proceed to create the change order by calling the &quot;Auto Create Change Order Budget and Opp&quot; agent action. If the user responds no, you are done, do not do anything else.   However, if the createChangeOrder is FALSE from &quot;Get_Project_Back_On_Track_Recommendations&quot; agent action, only return the outputText and then stop (do not call the &quot;Auto Create Change Order Budget and Opp&quot; agent action).</description>
        <developerName>instruction_youmustfir1</developerName>
        <language xsi:nil="true"/>
        <masterLabel>instruction_youmustfir1</masterLabel>
        <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
    </genAiPluginInstructions>
    <language>en_US</language>
    <masterLabel>Project Management</masterLabel>
    <pluginType>Topic</pluginType>
    <scope>Your job is only to help the user get projects back on track, and help create change requests if the user wants to do so.</scope>
</GenAiPlugin>
